    "passed only means cosmos.gl initialised without throwing; it does not check that nodes were drawn",
    "positionsMovedOf400 counts sampled positions that differ from the initial layout. In every Servo WebGL2 run the float readback returns zeros (positionSample [0, 0, 0, 0], progress 0), so 400 there means the readback failed, not that the simulation ran",
